    - lineId: market_lifeline-debrief-02
      textKey: narrative.market_lifeline.debrief.02
      englishFallback: This is the compromised transfer. The same false seals appear
        at several Relay-era storage sites. Take the record; the market workers will
        keep the real route moving.
      speaker: 1
