    - lineId: market_lifeline-brief-02
      textKey: narrative.market_lifeline.brief.02
      englishFallback: The market is not the enemy. Escort all three trucks, defeat
        the armed cell, then move one rifle squad to the manifest table and hold
        there for six seconds to verify the transfer.
      speaker: 2
      voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      femaleVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
